<title>USA: TransTexas Gas drills third Dickinson well.</title>
<headline>TransTexas Gas drills third Dickinson well.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>TransTexas Gas Corp said Friday it drilled its third well in the newly discovered oil field in Dickinson, N.D.</p>
<p>The company said the Dinsdale number 1-3 was drilled to a total depth of 10,768 feet and logged an oil column of 78 feet in a gross interval between 10,350 and 10,600 feet, as indicated by electric logs.</p>
<p>The company said the well is expected to be completed and flowing to sales before the end of February.</p>
</text>
